      "subtopic": "Calculus",
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "stem": "If f(x,y) = x²y³ + xy⁴ + sin x + cos²x + sin³y, what is ∂f/∂x?",
      "choices": {
        "A": "(2x+y)y³ + 3sin²y·cos y",
